{\b Kariz Server (server edition)}\par
\par
This package installs the application server, a PostgreSQL database server (PostgreSQL License), pgvector (PostgreSQL License), Node.js (MIT License) and WinSW (MIT License) on this computer. Their license texts are installed next to each component.\par
\par
The server works without Internet access. Data stays in the data folder you choose (C:\\ProgramData\\Kariz by default) and is kept when the product is uninstalled unless you ask for its removal.\par
\par
Use of the application is subject to the agreement between your organisation and the vendor.\par
